270	    /**
271	     * Normalizes a postal address into a canonical form: surrounding whitespace is trimmed and
272	     * internal runs of whitespace collapsed to a single space, the value is upper-cased and common
273	     * abbreviations are expanded as whole tokens ({@code ST -> STREET}, {@code RD -> ROAD},
274	     * {@code AVE -> AVENUE}). So {@code '  12  main  st '} is stored and returned as
