285	    /**
286	     * Normalizes a telephone number into canonical E.164 form: a leading {@code '+'} and country
287	     * code are kept when present, otherwise country code {@code '+61'} is assumed and a single
288	     * leading {@code '0'} is dropped from the national digits; spaces, dashes and brackets are
